        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="card_bizobs" value="Business Observability&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:9px;font-weight:normal&quot;&gt;Classification: Supporting&lt;br&gt;Audience: Hybrid&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px;font-weight:bold;color:#0e7490&quot;&gt;IMPLEMENTED_UNVERIFIED&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:9px;font-weight:normal&quot;&gt;FOUNDATION&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:8px;font-weight:normal;color:#92400e&quot;&gt;v1 scope: Source, Pricing, Channels, Write Pipeline producers. Maturity held at Owner's prior FOUNDATION pending explicit Owner review.&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f0fdf4;strokeColor=#16a34a;strokeWidth=2;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Trebuchet MS,Verdana,Arial,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="940" y="455" width="280" height="150" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="notes_box" value="Notes on this snapshot" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=8;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#94a3b8;strokeWidth=1.2;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#334155;fontFamily=Trebuchet MS,Verdana,Arial,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1240" y="455" width="550" height="230" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="note1" value="• No domain is rated IMPLEMENTED. Static evidence (mounted routes, real modules, present tests) is capped at IMPLEMENTED_UNVERIFIED without runtime/Owner verification." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=10;fontColor=#334155;fontFamily=Trebuchet MS,Verdana,Arial,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1250" y="480" width="530" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="note2" value="• PARTIAL means mixed evidence found: real backend/API alongside dead-stub routers or a missing UI surface, not that the domain is broken." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=10;fontColor=#334155;fontFamily=Trebuchet MS,Verdana,Arial,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1250" y="525" width="530" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="note3" value="• Repository evidence may confirm or downgrade a rating; it must never silently upgrade one. See CAPABILITY_REGISTRY.md Methodology for the exact evidence per domain." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=10;fontColor=#334155;fontFamily=Trebuchet MS,Verdana,Arial,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1250" y="570" width="530" height="45" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="note4" value="• Current evidence: Products through Unified Workspace is the operator-facing multi-channel price editor; the legacy Product Pricing API is a tested compatibility facade, not a UI gap. Open items affecting these ratings: unmounted target feature routers (cross-cutting), audit/logger.py disposition (Audit &amp; Governance), and Shadow Validation C5 orchestration. See 00-flowhub-master.drawio verify band." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=10;fontColor=#334155;fontFamily=Trebuchet MS,Verdana,Arial,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1250" y="620" width="530" height="55" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
